{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Glitch Party is a party game for 2-8 players online. Challenge your friends in different minigames, each with a small chance of being glitched. Welcome to Glitch Party!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2270230/extras/df9e8dfd78299463e499f3e72f4ba840.poster.avif?t=1758643108\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2270230/extras/df9e8dfd78299463e499f3e72f4ba840.webm?t=1758643108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2270230/extras/df9e8dfd78299463e499f3e72f4ba840.mp4?t=1758643108\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minigames</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete in varius different minigames. Racing, fighting, strategic competitions, last to survive, and many others. Powered by Unreal Engine 5 you get beautiful maps, physics, and lighting. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Glitched Version</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each minigame has a small chance of spawning as a glitched version. With more action, and different twists, it spices things up. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Characters</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between 8 different characters each with their own voice. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Development</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Glitch Party is made by Gyllensten Games, a solo developer game studio creating its first game.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2270230?t=1758643108","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2270230?t=1758643108","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2270230/aaa887945d6fc1cbaebf9fff7d98d2b9511f8655/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758643108","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2270230/aaa887945d6fc1cbaebf9fff7d98d2b9511f8655/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758643108","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Glitch Party is a party game for 2-8 players online. Challenge your friends in different minigames, each with a small chance of being glitched. Welcome to Glitch Party!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2270230/extras/df9e8dfd78299463e499f3e72f4ba840.poster.avif?t=1758643108\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2270230/extras/df9e8dfd78299463e499f3e72f4ba840.webm?t=1758643108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2270230/extras/df9e8dfd78299463e499f3e72f4ba840.mp4?t=1758643108\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minigames</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete in varius different minigames. Racing, fighting, strategic competitions, last to survive, and many others. Powered by Unreal Engine 5 you get beautiful maps, physics, and lighting. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Glitched Version</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each minigame has a small chance of spawning as a glitched version. With more action, and different twists, it spices things up. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Characters</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between 8 different characters each with their own voice. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Development</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Glitch Party is made by Gyllensten Games, a solo developer game studio creating its first game.</p>","developers":["Gyllensten Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2270230/4af59236347f36c229f1832239b49aa9129aa0e0/header.jpg?t=1758643108","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2270230/1322184872/37bb1bc51fcab7188b0ec3ae93ad4b73b07ddb35/1751097130/dash_av1.mpd?t=1748108089","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2270230/1322184872/37bb1bc51fcab7188b0ec3ae93ad4b73b07ddb35/1751097130/dash_h264.mpd?t=1748108089","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2270230/1322184872/37bb1bc51fcab7188b0ec3ae93ad4b73b07ddb35/1751097130/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1748108089","id":256924346,"name":"Glitch Party","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256924346/ef9fba363538e12b6eb18d99889da9b4bceddead/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1748108089"}],"name":"Glitch Party","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"